    "detailed_description": "If you are interested in puzzle games, 369 will appeal to you <br />\r\nJoin 369 in an adventure full of excitement and fear and find your way through a dangerous labyrinth by destroying demonic creatures and solving various puzzles. 369 takes you with it and plunges you into the depth of a story full of excitement, apprehension and fear and shows you the way of life.<br />\r\nIt leads you through deadly mazes and full of dangerous traps, and when you reach the three-headed dragon, you have to fight him with all your might.<br />\r\n But before the battle to the big dragon, you have to deal with the space robots and bomb and destroy their equipment.<br />\r\nYou need to upgrade your weapons because you won't last long with the existing weapons<br />\r\nI have participated in this battle many times and have a lot of experience, so listen to the advice of an experienced warrior.<br />\r\n................................................................<br />\r\n369 challenges your mind hard. You need all your intelligence to solve the puzzles of the game. This is not a shooting game. You only have a shield that you will get from the third stage and no other weapons. You have to think to solve the puzzles.<br />\r\nOf course, in the mini game you have an advanced laser weapon that can be upgraded and updated.",
    "about_the_game": "If you are interested in puzzle games, 369 will appeal to you <br />\r\nJoin 369 in an adventure full of excitement and fear and find your way through a dangerous labyrinth by destroying demonic creatures and solving various puzzles. 369 takes you with it and plunges you into the depth of a story full of excitement, apprehension and fear and shows you the way of life.<br />\r\nIt leads you through deadly mazes and full of dangerous traps, and when you reach the three-headed dragon, you have to fight him with all your might.<br />\r\n But before the battle to the big dragon, you have to deal with the space robots and bomb and destroy their equipment.<br />\r\nYou need to upgrade your weapons because you won't last long with the existing weapons<br />\r\nI have participated in this battle many times and have a lot of experience, so listen to the advice of an experienced warrior.<br />\r\n................................................................<br />\r\n369 challenges your mind hard. You need all your intelligence to solve the puzzles of the game. This is not a shooting game. You only have a shield that you will get from the third stage and no other weapons. You have to think to solve the puzzles.<br />\r\nOf course, in the mini game you have an advanced laser weapon that can be upgraded and updated.",
